            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nSome of them might be useful to people: like 'tutor' for newcomers (as 'mini.basics' is more or less targeted for them) and 'matchit'. So the interface will be mostly the same as if disabling them manually, which I don't think is a good design.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
